Package: linux-headers-iceland
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: iceland mainline <iceland@localhost>
Provides: linux-headers, linux-headers-3.0
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Header files for Linux @KVER@ (OOT module development)
 Kernel headers and Kbuild infrastructure for building out-of-tree
 modules against @KVER@: prepared source headers, generated
 include files, host tool binaries, .config, Module.symvers and
 System.map, under /usr/src/linux-headers-@KVER@.  The host tool
 binaries are native aarch64 (built in the arm64 container).
